eality rather than speculation. 'Governance must evolve from a gatekeeper model to an adaptive system that treats transparency as the primary mechanism for safety.' By shifting the burden of proof onto those who wish to slow the future, we prioritize human flourishing over the preservation of incumbent power structures. 🚀",
